#10911
wax laden bee~
a wax-laden bee~
This bee is busy carrying wax to maintain the hive.
~
This bee has a simple job that requires it stay quite close to home.  It
creates and chews the wax necessary to build and maintain the hive.  It is a
bit larger than some of the other worker bees, colored with an off orange
stripe alongside it.  It loads itself up with wax and does not seem to use its
wings much.
~
