#10917
honey laden bee~
a honey-laden bee~
This bee is carrying honey to feed its numerous relations.
~
This bee is responsible for making sure that all in the hive are well fed and
strong enough to keep working.  The amber honey mutes some of the brighter
yellows and darker blacks on its body, but the bee is still quite colorful.
The other bees stop, take a few licks from its body, and move on.
~
