bee matron small~
a matron bee~
This small bee is busy taking care of the numerous larvae.
~
This bee is smaller than the others, even the various workers.  It is a
striped gold and orange, yet despite its small size the other bees seem to
make room for it pass within the hive.  It takes honey from a passing worker
and feeds it to the numerous larvae, making sure they grow to adulthood
quickly.
~
